 less than 2 seconds when it is unloaded.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open VoiceMeeter (in my case, VoiceMeeter Potato).\n2. Route the default Windows audio output to VoiceMeeter: This can be done by setting VoiceMeeter as the default playback device in the Windows sound settings.\n3. Launch the Godot editor.\n4. Observe the increased loading time (e.g., opening the Project List takes significantly longer than usual).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot needed. Simply launch the editor and wait for the Project List to load.","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101756/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}